= Objectives and Work Programme

== Anticipated Total Duration of the Project

6 months.

== Objectives

This project aims to determine the network architecture underlying the target phenomenon. Building on established behavioural and physiological signatures, the present project extends this work to the network level by asking three specific questions:

+ Does the target phenomenon engage the same network as its conscious counterpart, and if so, is this engagement simply weaker?
+ Does it recruit a fundamentally different network architecture?
+ Or does it operate without any systematic large-scale connectivity at all?

These hypotheses are not mutually exclusive across all levels of analysis.

