== Handling of Research Data

Data management follows the FAIR principles:

*Findable:* The underlying datasets are available through collaboration with the original authors.
*Accessible:* Processed data and analysis scripts will be shared via an open repository.
*Interoperable:* All outputs will conform to community standards.
*Reusable:* Analysis code will be version-controlled and accompanied by documentation.

